### User Service - User Registration & Management
### This file contains HTTP requests for testing the User Service API
### Use with IntelliJ IDEA REST Client or VS Code REST Client extension

### ============================================================
### IMPORTANT: GATEWAY vs DIRECT SERVICE CALLS
### ============================================================
###
### Architecture Choice:
### 1. DIRECT SERVICE (Current - Port 8081):
###    - Use when testing User Service in isolation
###    - Better for debugging individual service
###    - Requires User Service running ONLY
###    - No gateway dependency
###
### 2. THROUGH GATEWAY (Port 8080):
###    - Use when testing complete microservices flow
###    - Requires Gateway, User Service, and all other services
###    - Routes requests through API Gateway
###    - More realistic production-like testing
###    - Change @baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
###
### CURRENT SETUP: Direct Service Testing
### - User Service: http://localhost:8081
### - If you want Gateway routing: Change baseUrl to http://localhost:8080
###

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@apiVersion = /api/v1
@contentType = application/json

### ============================================================
### ADMIN USERS (First 2 users)
### ============================================================

### 1. Register Admin User - Alice Johnson
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiVersion}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "alice.johnson@bennycar.de",
  "password": "SecureAdminPass2024!",
  "firstName": "Alice",
  "lastName": "Johnson",
  "phoneNumber": "+49-30-123456789",
  "profilePictureUrl": "https://cdn.bennycar.de/profiles/alice-johnson.jpg",
  "address": "Kurfürstendamm 26, 10719 Berlin, Germany"
}

> {% client.assert(response.status === 201, "Admin user Alice registration failed"); %}

### 2. Register Admin User - Bob Mueller
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiVersion}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "bob.mueller@bennycar.de",
